# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored.

# ─── Google sign-in (required) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Google Cloud Console → APIs & Services → Credentials → Create OAuth client ID → "Desktop app"
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=

# ─── ElevenLabs voice agent (optional; no conversation starts yet) ────────────
# The future AI participant in calls, behind src/integrations/voice. When set, startup checks the key and
# agent and logs "[voice] ElevenLabs agent ready" (or why not).
# API key: elevenlabs.io → Settings → API Keys. Stays in the main process, never sent to a renderer.
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=
# Agent ID (agent_…, not a model name): elevenlabs.io → Agents → create agent, keep it private (we connect
# via signed URL), and copy its ID from the agent's page. Leave its audio formats at PCM.
# Configure it in the dashboard with:
#   LLM:  Claude Opus 5.5 (claude-opus-5-5), low effort — swap to Claude Haiku 5.5 if turn latency is too high
#   TTS:  eleven_v4_turbo   (~100ms, recommended for agents; eleven_flash_v2_5 ~75ms if you need faster)
#   STT:  scribe_realtime
ELEVENLABS_AGENT_ID=

# ─── Supabase cloud backend (optional; without it everything stays local) ─────
# supabase.com → project → Settings → API Keys. The publishable key (or legacy anon key) is safe
# to ship: every table is behind row-level security. Never put the secret/service_role key here.
# Also enable Auth → Providers → Google and add GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID under "Client IDs".
SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=

# ─── Vowe cloud API (optional) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The deployed server/ (DigitalOcean App Platform; docs/DIGITALOCEAN_HANDOFF.md), no trailing slash.
# When set, call tokens and ElevenLabs signed URLs come from it, and the ELEVENLABS_* keys above can be
# left empty: the API holds them. Locally: VOWE_API_URL=http://localhost:8080 with `pnpm api:start`.
VOWE_API_URL=

# ─── LiveKit voice calls: nothing to set here ─────────────────────────────────
# Calls need Supabase. The LiveKit URL, API key and secret live server-side: in the Vowe API's env
# (with VOWE_API_URL) or as Supabase secrets read by the livekit-token Edge Function; see README → Voice calls.

# ─── Vowe collaborator agent (optional; the text agent on the developer screen) ─
# console.anthropic.com → API Keys. Stays in the main process. Instead of a key you can run `ant auth login`.
# Only what the agent's tools return is sent: session metadata, Git status and diffs, and transcript
# excerpts from sessions you approve in the app. Nothing is sent until you ask the agent something.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Defaults: claude-opus-5-5 at medium effort (low | medium | high | xhigh | max).
VOWE_AGENT_MODEL=
VOWE_AGENT_EFFORT=
# Declined requests are retried on Anthropic's recommended fallback model; set to off to disable.
VOWE_AGENT_FALLBACKS=
